                  "text": "As a leader in this role, my responsibilities encompass:\n\nDefining and enabling strategic blueprints, roadmaps, goals, and action plans.\nBuilding capability and capacity for MedTech product engineering across hardware and software domains.\nImplementing software transformation initiatives for digital and connected care journey applications spanning web, mobile, and cloud platforms.\nBeing accountable for business process improvement, project and program lifecycle management, and enhancing the productivity of software engineering teams.\nDriving essential conversations through metrics, dashboards, and Quarterly Business Reviews (QBR).\nFacilitating critical communication and fostering team engagement.\nServing as a mentor and coach for talent development.\nEnabling various initiatives including talent development, operational excellence, program and quality excellence, and fostering innovation and technical excellence."
